{{> Top}}<article class="prose">
<h1>Competitors</h1>
<p>These five, and no others: the field is closed. Any of them may be made faster, fairly (<a href="/contribute">Contribute</a>).</p>
<p>Each card says how the server waits on the network (io), renders the menu page (templates), talks to SQLite (db), and is built.</p>
<div class="cards competitors">
{{#competitors}}<section class="card competitor"><h3><span class="swatch s-{{ name }}"></span>{{ name }}</h3><p class="lang">{{ language }}</p>
<dl class="facts"><dt>io</dt><dd>{{ io }}</dd><dt>templates</dt><dd>{{ templates }}</dd><dt>db</dt><dd>{{ db }}</dd><dt>build</dt><dd class="build">{{ build }}</dd></dl>
<p class="links">{{#links}}<a href="{{ href }}">{{ label }}</a>{{/links}}</p>
<p class="about">{{ about }}</p></section>
{{/competitors}}</div>
<h2>Versions</h2>
<p>Everything is pinned, and each race records what it raced. fourneau and roux are the two things that move, on purpose: a race takes the newest commit of each.</p>
<table>
<thead><tr><th>what</th><th>pinned to</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
{{#pins}}<tr><td>{{ name }}</td><td>{{ version }}</td></tr>
{{/pins}}</tbody>
</table>
</article>
{{> Bottom}}